# Qwen 4 Max — findings by Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B A55B

- Source: Alibaba Cloud / Qwen (`qwen4-max-preview`)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 4 Max (Preview)
- **Short description:** Alibaba's Qwen 4 Max Preview — next-generation flagship multimodal MoE model with deep thinking, image/video understanding, tool calling, and structured output. Available via Alibaba Cloud Model Studio Token Plan (subscription) only during preview period 2026-11-11 to 2026-11-25 (UTC+8).
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (百炼) — API ID `qwen4-max-preview`. Token Plan only (personal/team subscriptions with Credits). Base URL: `https://token-plan.cn-beijing.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1`. Compatible with OpenAI Chat Completions, Responses API, and Anthropic Messages API. No free tier on OpenCode Zen or OpenRouter.
- **Release / knowledge:** Preview released 2026-11-11; preview period ends 2026-11-25 (UTC+8); knowledge cutoff not publicly specified.
- **IDs:** `qwen4-max-preview` (Model Studio Token Plan). No pay-as-you-go billing during preview.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total; max output 393,216 tokens (thinking + final answer share this budget). Verified via Model Studio docs.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output. Reasoning: yes (deep thinking, default on, adjustable via `reasoning_effort`: low/medium/xhigh). Tool calls: yes (Function Calling, web search, built-in tools). JSON mode: supported (JSON Object and JSON Schema). Audio: not supported (use Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash for audio).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Token Plan subscription only (Credits-based). Personal Standard/Pro and Team plans available. No per-token public pricing published; Credits consumed per request. No free tier.
- **Architecture:** MoE (Mixture of Experts); proprietary; parameter count not disclosed. Part of Qwen 4 generation.

